text SaffronCity_Mart_Text_MaxRepelMoreEffectiveThanSuper {
    "MAX REPEL keeps weaker POKéMON\n"
    "from appearing.\p"
    "MAX REPEL stays effective longer\n"
    "than SUPER REPEL.$"
}

text SaffronCity_Mart_Text_ReviveIsCostly {
    "REVIVE is costly, but it revives\n"
    "fainted POKéMON!$"
}
